<!--
    A struct passed by address to an SDK-declared method parameter
    (`option objcsdk <dir>`): the fast-enumeration state of a for-in loop.

    Issue: `for (id x in c)` sends `countByEnumeratingWithState:objects:count:`
    with the address of a stack `NSFastEnumerationState` and reads its
    `itemsPtr` and `mutationsPtr` members afterwards. The header reader turned
    the `NSFastEnumerationState *` parameter into a class pointer, the array
    parameter `(id [])` and a generic class's `(K [])` spelling into nothing it
    could encode, so the selector had no prototype; and a `^{Name=...}` pointer
    encoding decoded to `void *`. With no type on the call, the eight words of
    the state printed as eight unrelated locals and the loop read
    `*(unsigned long *)(v6 + v5 * 8)` for `state.itemsPtr[i]`.

    Stage / sub-stage: P1 external-refinement. `analyzers/objc/kuna_objcsdk.rs`
    records the body of each `typedef struct { ... } Name;` and encodes a
    pointer to it with its layout and member names
    (`^{NSFastEnumerationState="state"Q"itemsPtr"^@"mutationsPtr"^Q"extra"[5Q]}`),
    an array parameter as a pointer to its element, and a lightweight generic
    parameter as `id`; `analyzers/objc/encoding.rs` decodes a pointer to a named
    struct layout as a pointer to that struct. The typelocked pointer parameter
    then types the stack object whose address is passed (P6 `gatherOpen`), so
    the eight words are one `NSFastEnumerationState` variable.

    P0 assertion: `option objcsdk <directory>|off` (an env-bridged load-time
    setting, so it is set BEFORE the `load file` it applies to and cleared at
    the end so the harness process carries nothing into the next test).

    The fixture is `macho_objc_forin.m`: `Bag` declared and never implemented,
    every send a linker stub; `tests/fixtures/objc_sdk/Enumeration.h` is a
    hand-written header (no Apple text) declaring the state and the selector.

    Pass 1 (`objc on`, no headers) reproduces the BUG: the state is loose words
    and the element is read through a bare word.
    Pass 2 (`objc on`, `objcsdk` pointed at the header directory) is the FIX:
    one `NSFastEnumerationState` local, `v1.itemsPtr[i]`, `*v1.mutationsPtr`,
    and the buffer is an array of object pointers.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x100000" readonly="true">
c0035fd6
</bytechunk>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x100000" name="harness_stub"/>
